TASK 3 (10 marks)
The C and Pascal programs below perform the same task. Select any one of them and answer the questions that follow.
C Program
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) {
int num;
printf("Enter a number: ");
scanf("%d",&num);
while (num < 5) {
printf("%d ",num);
num = num+1;
}
getchar();
}
Pascal Program
program Numbers;
var num: integer;
BEGIN
write('Enter a number: ');
readln(num);
while num < 5 do
begin
write(num,' ');
num := num + 1;
end;
readln;
END.
